  "_comment": [
    "Crop vocabulary. 'slug' becomes the taxonomy URI path:",
    "  https://taxonomy.openagrinet.global/crop/<slug>",
    "An LLM never mints one of these URIs. If the rules cannot resolve a term it",
    "stays unresolved and is counted in the extraction report, because a wrong",
    "subject URI is worse than a missing one: discovery would route a farmer to a",
    "provider that cannot help, and nothing downstream could tell.",
    "",
    "Aliases include Hindi (for the UP and Rajasthan bulletins) and the local",
    "English names Indian agromet bulletins actually use ('red gram' for tur,",
    "'bengal gram' for chickpea, 'paddy' for rice)."
